   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Boil the eggs 7–8 minutes from the fridge, then straight into cold water and peel. Firmer than the <a href=\"ramen-egg.html\">6-minute ramen egg</a>, so they hold up to being pressed in rice.</li><li>Boil the soy sauce, sake, mirin and sugar for a minute and let it cool.</li><li>Eggs and marinade into a zip bag, fridge for a few hours to overnight. <b>Save the marinade</b> — it seasons the bakudan rice.</li></ul>",
