   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>While the rice cooks:<ul class=\"ing\"><li><b>Salted salmon:</b> salt both sides, broil or bake at <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"218\" data-s=\"0\">218 °C</span> for 10–20 minutes until well done and flaky, then flake it</li><li><b>Okaka:</b> katsuobushi moistened (not drenched) with the soy sauce</li><li><b>Tuna-mayo:</b> drained tuna + mayo + soy sauce</li><li><b>Umeboshi:</b> pits out, flesh on a plate</li></ul></li></ul>",
